WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.920
Mayor's office.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:08.520
Hi, I'm Jessica Perez, I'm
meeting with Mayor Wilson, and she said she

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.100
was sending a car over to pick me up at the airport.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.950
Can I please see you on a brief hold while I
check on this?

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.700
Yes. Of course.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.100
Excuse me.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.870
Oh, I am so sorry.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:44.490
I didn't mean to hit it. I- it got stuck.
Please. All yours. Just steer clear of 'D'.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.570
Actually I was-

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.160
Yes, I'm here. Yes.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.120
Thank you. Right.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.050
Thank you for your patience.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.050
I just spoke with the mayor and your ride
should be there.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.050
At Tapeesa Airport?

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:55.650
Yes.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.050
Well, I don't know what to tell you because I'm
standing in the

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:04.860
middle of the only hangar in existence, and
there is no one else here- Oh... you know,

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:06.930
thank you for your help. I think I found him.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.630
Are you my ride?

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.130
Matt Holden.

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:14.160
My family grows the jingle bell flowers for
the festival.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.980
Mayor Wilson asked me to make
sure that you had everything that you needed.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:22.290
Yes. Good. Thank you. I'm so sorry about
before, I. I guess I was just expecting

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:26.130
someone, you know, with a sign.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.570
A sign?

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:31.050
With my name on it? So, they can find me
at the gate.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:36.540
Right. Wouldn't want to miss you with all
these people here.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:37.040
Right.

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:40.280
Are those my cookies?

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:45.440
Oh, yeah, I mean, I did spring them free. We
can share.

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:47.390
Oh, no, I don't think so.

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:53.480
Okay, well, my truck is parked outside.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:55.250
Oh, wait.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:57.080
Truck?

